e 2: P2 drinks Mirinda.\nIf P2 drinks Mirinda, then P1 must drink Cola.\nFrom the first condition, if P2 watches Superhero, then P1 listens to Classical.\nFrom the second condition, if P2 listens to Pop, then P1 does not drink Cola. This is a contradiction.\nSo, P2 cannot drink Mirinda.\n\nTherefore, the only possible scenarios are:\n1. P1 = Mirinda, Superhero, P2 = Cola, Classical\n2. P1 = Mirinda, Spy, P2 = Cola, Classical\n\nIn both cases, the person who drinks mirinda is in position 1.\nIn both cases, the person who listens to classical is in position 2.\nIn both cases, the person who drinks cola listens to pop.\n\nSo, the movie genre of the person who drinks mirinda is either Superhero or Spy.\nThe position of the person who drinks mirinda is 1.\nThe movie genre of the person who listens to classical is Superhero.\nThe music genre of the person who drinks cola is Pop.\n\nFinal answer: Superhero, 1, Superhero, Pop</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.0012634160229936242}, {"token": "'", "logprob": -0.009559687227010727}, {"token": "s", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁analyze", "logprob": -0.5453031659126282}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -1.3232143828645349e-05}, {"token": "▁given", "logprob": -0.13984474539756775}, {"token": "▁information", "logprob": -0.00023123928986024112}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.6279668807983398}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.9264184236526489}, {"token": "Let", "logprob": -0.14931097626686096}, {"token": "▁Person", "logprob": -1.1481297016143799}, {"token": "▁", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁be", "logprob": -0.0016777737764641643}, {"token": "▁P", "logprob": -0.6172372102737427}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁and", "logprob": -0.0004323977918829769}, {"token": "▁Person", "logprob": -4.172316494077677e-06}, {"token": "▁", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁be", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁P", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "lo